Join our team at a company that produces high-quality bows, arrows, and shields!

Location: Nieuwkuijk, Netherlands

Position: Production Worker (Packing Department)

Shift: Day shift

Requirements for this job:

- Language: Dutch or English

- Accommodation: Own accommodation What will you do?

What will you do:

- The first tasks you will start with are packing rolls of paper and nets.

- Once you do this well and show that you want to learn more, there is potential to expand into logistics tasks;

- This could include unloading goods, unpacking, registering, and repacking;

- Collecting orders using a handheld scanner or the automated system;

- Packing packages and preparing them for shipment. Who are you?

- You are enthusiastic, flexible, and enjoy taking responsibility;

- You have (some) experience in logistics – or you are eager to learn;

- You speak English or Dutch, this is to ensure safety in the warehouse.

What we offer:
• A varied job in a growing, international company;
• Competitive salary and good employment benefits;
• The possibility of a permanent contract with good performance;
• A healthy work/life balance – you only work during the day, from Monday to Friday;
• 25 vacation days per year (based on full-time) with the option to buy 2 extra weeks;
• Travel allowance, 8% holiday pay, and pension scheme;
• Plenty of opportunities to learn, develop yourself, and grow along with the company;
• Fun drinks, team outings, and activities organized by our own activities committee!

